  "rules": [
    "Buy when the daily close crosses above its 5-day EMA plus twice the average daily range of the last 5 days, a day that moves about double the recent norm.",
    "Sell 3 days later, whatever the price.",
    "Hold one position per coin at a time, with no stop loss."
  ],
  "notExpressed": [
    "The framework compares the day's move with the prior five-day average move; a 5-day Keltner channel (2 times the 5-day range) stands in for that comparison",
    "Its alternative exit, selling as soon as momentum fades (no rule is given for it)",
    "The optional RSI or CCI confirmation (no thresholds are given)"
  ],
